## Interface: 16001
## Title: MGA Dungeon Quests
## Notes: A dungeon journal for WoW Forever: every dungeon, its bosses and loot, and every quest to pick up for it, ticked with the quests you've done, and map pins plus a route for the quests you're ready to turn in, inside a dungeon it tracks only that dungeon's quests and says what's left before you leave, and it notes where each Craftsman's Writ is delivered. The MGA minimap button opens it.
